# Pinned SHA-256 of the shared CI lib (ops/shared/ci/ci-lib.sh).
#
# run-pipeline.sh and install-ci.sh verify the lib against this pin BEFORE
# sourcing it (Sec L21). The lib is shared infrastructure outside the
# repo, so a commit cannot tamper with it — the pin only guards against
# an unreviewed local change to the lib.
#
# Update ONLY when the shared lib changes deliberately: review the lib
# diff, recompute the hash, commit the new pin. The pipeline fails
# closed on a mismatch, so a stale pin blocks every run until updated.
#
# Pinned from ops/shared @ d98b7f7c22a2e911b9cda6f74495d7c856c53cfe (2026-11-21).
